Description Task 3: Copy the file '/usr/local/share/rke2/rke2-cis-sysctl.conf' or '/opt/rke2/share/rke2/rke2-cis-sysctl.conf' to '/etc/sysctl.d/60-rke2-cis.conf' with mode 0600. The source file is selected based on whether the '/usr/local' directory is writeable and the result of a partition check. After copying, restart the systemd-sysctl service.

Task 4: Flush handlers
Description Task 4: Flush all handlers that have been notified during the execution of the playbook to ensure they are executed before the playbook ends.

